# Stack Profile（例）

アプリ開発開始時に `doc/stack.md.example` をコピーして `doc/stack.md` を作成し、値を確定する。
AI エージェント（build-agent / test-agent / review-agent）は **本ファイルを正本** としてスタック固有の規約・コマンドを読む。

---

## Status

```yaml
status: active          # template | active
profile: typescript-workers   # 識別子（任意）
```

## Languages & runtime

```yaml
languages:
  - TypeScript
runtime: Cloudflare Workers
package_manager: npm    # npm | pnpm | uv | poetry | go mod
```

## Source layout

```yaml
source_roots:
  - src/
layout: |
  src/core/       — orchestration, routing, handlers
  src/services/   — external integrations (KV, fetch, APIs)
  src/utils/      — pure helpers
  src/types/      — shared contracts
test_roots:
  - tests/
test_file_glob: "tests/**/*.test.ts"
source_glob: "src/**/*.ts"
```

Python 例:

```yaml
# languages: [Python]
# source_roots: [src/]
# layout: |
#   src/<package>/  — application code
# test_roots: [tests/]
# test_file_glob: "tests/**/*.py"
# source_glob: "src/**/*.py"
```

Go 例:

```yaml
# languages: [Go]
# source_roots: [cmd/, internal/]
# test_file_glob: "**/*_test.go"
# source_glob: "**/*.go"
```

VS Code Extension 例:

```yaml
# profile: vscode-extension
# languages: [TypeScript]
# runtime: VS Code Extension Host
# package_manager: npm
# source_roots: [src/]
# layout: |
#   src/extension.ts    — activate / deactivate
#   src/commands/       — command handlers
#   src/providers/      — Language Features, TreeDataProvider
#   src/webviews/       — Webview panels
#   src/test/           — @vscode/test-electron integration tests
# test_roots: [src/test/]
# test_file_glob: "src/test/suite/**/*.test.ts"
# source_glob: "src/**/*.ts"
# test_runner: "@vscode/test-electron"
# test_all: "npm run test"
# test_single: "npm run test -- --grep '{pattern}'"
# typecheck: "npm run typecheck"
# compile: "npm run compile"
# cursor_rules:
#   - templates/rules/vscode-extension.mdc
#   - templates/rules/tests-vscode-extension.mdc
```

## Test runner

```yaml
test_runner: vitest     # vitest | jest | pytest | go test
test_all: "npm test"
test_single: "npx vitest run {file}"
```

Python / Go 例:

```yaml
# test_runner: pytest
# test_all: "uv run pytest"
# test_single: "uv run pytest {file}"
#
# test_runner: go test
# test_all: "go test ./..."
# test_single: "go test {package} -run {pattern}"
```

## Quality commands

```yaml
typecheck: "npm run typecheck"    # 不要なら null
lint: null
format: null
```

## Secrets & config

```yaml
secrets_policy: |
  - Secrets in Wrangler Secrets or .dev.vars — never in git
  - Do not commit tokens in wrangler.toml [vars]
tracked_config_paths:
  - wrangler.toml
forbidden_secret_paths:
  - wrangler.toml
  - .env
```

Python 例:

```yaml
# secrets_policy: |
#   - Use .env locally (gitignored); production via platform secrets
# forbidden_secret_paths: [.env, credentials.json]
```

## Active Cursor rules

`templates/rules/` から `.cursor/rules/` にコピーして有効化するファイル:

```yaml
cursor_rules:
  - templates/rules/typescript-workers.mdc
  - templates/rules/tests-typescript.mdc
```

コピー後は globs が本リポジトリのパスと一致するか確認する。

## Stack-specific review notes

レビュー・デバッグ時の追加チェック（任意）:

```markdown
- Bindings (KV, triggers) must match wrangler.toml and systemspec
- Validate auth on webhooks; fail closed
- Mock KV, fetch, external APIs in unit tests
```

